        "faq_item_1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much time does it take?",
            "answer": "<p>About fifteen minutes a day for five days: a short video and one task. Day four, writing the first issue, takes most people forty minutes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need a newsletter tool already?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Day two shows how to set up a free account on the tool you choose, and the lessons work with any of them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I have nobody to send it to yet?",
            "answer": "<p>That is most people on day one. Day five is about your first readers: who to ask, and the message to send them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When does it start?",
            "answer": "<p>Every month, on the first Monday. Join any time before then. If you join mid round, you start on the next Monday.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it live?",
            "answer": "<p>The lessons are recorded, so you watch them when it suits you. Elise answers questions in the group every weekday during the round.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it is not for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Do the five days. If you did not send your first issue, or it was not worth the money, email within 14 days and you get a full refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I do it with a team?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Each person who writes needs a place, and the second place is half price. Write from the contact page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I keep the lessons?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The lessons, templates and bonuses are yours to keep after the round ends.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
